","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fMlSYOSIN5FXqruUivFEA5jaDcW.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"45411","synopsis":"A boost provided by super-popular idol Kiro posting about us on social media helps me to clear Victor's first condition, using the \"mysterious warping incidents\" as material for our show. Riding that momentum, I take my business plan to Victor, but he shoots it down, saying it lacks concrete specifics. While looking for an idea suitable for development among the ones we already have in-house, my gaze lands on a proposal concerning a restaurant with extremely mixed reviews - a restaurant called \"Souvenir.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xuQItLkpQjZIzLlML2BT1gSCg8b.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"A boost provided by super-popular idol Kiro posting about us on social media helps me to clear Victor's first condition, using the \"mysterious warping incidents\" as material for our show. Riding that momentum, I take my business plan to Victor, but he shoots it down, saying it lacks concrete specifics. While looking for an idea suitable for development among the ones we already have in-house, my gaze lands on a proposal concerning a restaurant with extremely mixed reviews - a restaurant called \"Souvenir.\"","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xuQItLkpQjZIzLlML2BT1gSCg8b.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber