recall... My father's death... and connected to everything, Black Swan. As I chase after the ever deepening mystery, I learn of a disappearance connected to my old high school. At the same time, after deciding to make the theme of our next show \"letters\" to tie in to a current hit movie, I head out to look into a ramen shop near my old high school. Along with research for the show, I feel I need to investigate the disappearance and head toward the high school, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofqkFs9Uazd9WQGxkxtiVbp8xZf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Memories I can't recall... My father's death... and connected to everything, Black Swan. As I chase after the ever deepening mystery, I learn of a disappearance connected to my old high school. At the same time, after deciding to make the theme of our next show \"letters\" to tie in to a current hit movie, I head out to look into a ramen shop near my old high school. Along with research for the show, I feel I need to investigate the disappearance and head toward the high school, but...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofqkFs9Uazd9WQGxkxtiVbp8xZf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"47299","synopsis":"I thought Lucien was taking me to do some research for \"Miracle Finder,\" but the road we travel stretches on and on through peaceful countryside. Refusing to tell me what we're researching, Lucien proposes a picnic for a change of pace. Meanwhile, after hearing from Shaw, someone allied with Black Swan, that there are rumors of a darker side to the Task Force, Gavin starts investigating things on his own.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5kwavA9FN7GsYGqoGw5KTM7mIl.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"I thought Lucien was taking me to do some research for \"Miracle Finder,\" but the road we travel stretches on and on through peaceful countryside. Refusing to tell me what we're researching, Lucien proposes a picnic for a change of pace. Meanwhile, after hearing from Shaw, someone allied with Black Swan, that there are rumors of a darker side to the Task Force, Gavin starts investigating things on his own.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g5kwavA9FN7GsYGqoGw5KTM7mIl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"47378","synopsis":"A request has come in from HBS, a big American broadcasting company, to work on a show together. Knowing we have to make the most of this chance, I manage to convince the first guest, LFG's CEO, Zen, to participate and we move toward filming. On the day of the shoot, I'm taken on a tour of the set to go over the content of the show. Somehow, I end up locked up alone in one of the set's jail rooms! In that moment, my memories begin to awaken...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v58ZZHj3dLhxtrxwA0AgYNqfARd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"A request has come in from HBS, a big American broadcasting company, to work on a show together. Knowing we have to make the most of this chance, I manage to convince the first guest, LFG's CEO, Zen, to participate and we move toward filming. On the day of the shoot, I'm taken on a tour of the set to go over the content of the show. Somehow, I end up locked up alone in one of the set's jail rooms! In that moment, my memories begin to awaken...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v58ZZHj3dLhxtrxwA0AgYNqfARd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"47705","synopsis":"In my dream, I saw room 404 of the Greenwood Hotel engulfed in flames, and lying collapsed in the middle of it, Haku. My unease sends me to the hotel I'd seen in my dream, but when I arrive, I'm told they have no room 404. Unable to erase the fear from my heart, I head up to the fourth floor to investigate and I find something that shouldn't exist - room 404.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vOFLeQHWrsT7ePpkmPU6kCQ9XfC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"In my dream, I saw room 404 of the Greenwood Hotel engulfed in flames, and lying collapsed in the middle of it, Haku. My unease sends me to the hotel I'd seen in my dream, but when I arrive, I'm told they have no room 404. Unable to erase the fear from my heart, I head up to the fourth floor to investigate and I find something that shouldn't exist - room 404.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vOFLeQHWrsT7ePpkmPU6kCQ9XfC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"48082","synopsis":"With his evol gone out of control, Gavin takes himself away from me. Around the same time, as a result of his fans going berserk, Kira announces his retirement, and no one can get in touch with Victor, who has gone missing. Our company receives tips on incidents which might be caused by evols which have gone out of control. In search of a clue as to some way of stopping the evols from running wild, I head to the university where Lucien works.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gHO0PKiZNsy2FfXS0ZHp36qLPT6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"With his evol gone out of control, Gavin takes himself away from me. Around the same time, as a result of his fans going berserk, Kira announces his retirement, and no one can get in touch with Victor, who has gone missing. Our company receives tips on incidents which might be caused by evols which have gone out of control. In search of a clue as to some way of stopping the evols from running wild, I head to the university where Lucien works.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gHO0PKiZNsy2FfXS0ZHp36qLPT6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"48115","synopsis":"I've learned a truth I don't want to believe, but I can't allow myself to stop now. I keep running. To block the electromagnetic waves causing evols to go out of control, I head to Loveland TV Tower. When I arrive, enforcement teams from Black Swan are already there. Left with no help, and no path left to take... behind me appears someone who was supposed to be missing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dmLfvxIU3Jz7N9C3nFNd74w2oP8.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"I've learned a truth I don't want to believe, but I can't allow myself to stop now. I keep running. To block the electromagnetic waves causing evols to go out of control, I head to Loveland TV Tower. When I arrive, enforcement teams from Black Swan are already there. Left with no help, and no path left to take... behind me appears someone who was supposed to be missing.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dmLfvxIU3Jz7N9C3nFNd74w2oP8.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15002","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"110371","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"40075","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"102285","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"384017","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"48201","synopsis":"Somehow, we managed to stop the triggering electromagnetic waves Black Swan had set up, but, after protecting me and remaining at Loveland TV Tower, Kiro has gone missing. Amidst all this, the general public has begun to feel uneasy about \"sleeping syndrome\" - incidents where people are falling asleep and not waking up. Could it be another of Black Swan's schemes...? To find th